Technically, the case that crashed in #104949 was from `editor/export/editor_export_platform.cpp:221`:
```cpp
bool EditorExportPlatform::_check_hash(const uint8_t *p_hash, const Vector<uint8_t> &p_data) {
        if (p_hash == nullptr) {
                return false;
        }

        unsigned char hash[16];
        Error err = CryptoCore::md5(p_data.ptr(), p_data.size(), hash);
```
`Vector<T>::size` is based on `CowData` and uses `Size`, which is a typedef for `int64_t`.
